# Reference fixture: constructs directly displayed in the NomadNet 1.4.2 Guide.
# Comment lines are intentionally included because the Guide says a leading # is hidden.

`lleft alignment
this line remains left aligned
`ccentred alignment
this line remains centred
`rright alignment
`aalignment reset to the document default

`!bold`! plain `_underlined`_ plain `*italic`* plain
`!`_`*combined styles`*`_`!
`F3a3-digit foreground`f default foreground
`B4443-digit background`b default background

`!bold before full reset``plain after full reset
`cright? no, this starts centre
centred until reset
``alignment and style reset
default after the reset
